{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-deu-26-1","title":"Deuteronomy 26:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The confession of him that offers the basket of first-fruits. 12 The prayer of him that gives his third year's tithes. 16 The covenant between God and his people.</p>\n<p>5:31; 6:1-10; 7:1; 13:1,9; 17:14; 18:9; Nu 15:2,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-2","title":"Deuteronomy 26:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>That thou shalt. 16:10; 18:4; Ex 23:16,19; 34:26; Le 2:12,14; Nu 18:12,13; 2Ki 4:42 2Ch 31:5; Ne 10:35-37; 12:44; 13:31; Pr 3:9,10; Jer 2:3; Eze 20:40 Eze 44:30; 48:14; Ro 8:23; 11:16; 16:5; 1Co 15:20,23; 16:2; Jas 1:18 Re 14:4 go unto. 12:5,6; Jos 18:1; 2Ch 6:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-3","title":"Deuteronomy 26:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the priest. 19:17; Heb 7:26; 10:21; 13:15; 1Pe 2:5 which the. Ge 17:8; 26:3; Ps 105:9,10; Lu 1:72,73; Heb 6:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-4","title":"Deuteronomy 26:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>before the. Mt 5:23,24; 23:19; Heb 13:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-5","title":"Deuteronomy 26:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>A Syrian.Jacob being called a Syrian from his long residence in Padan-aram.</p>\n<p>Ge 24:4; 25:20; 28:5; 31:20,24; Ho 12:12 ready. Ge 27:41; 31:40; 43:1,2,12; 45:7,11; Isa 51:1,2 he went down. Ge 46:1-7; Ps 105:23,24; Ac 7:15 a few. 7:7; Ge 46:27; Ex 1:5 became. 10:22; Ge 47:27; Ex 1:7,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-6","title":"Deuteronomy 26:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>4:20; Ex 1:11,14,16,22; 5:9,19,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-7","title":"Deuteronomy 26:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>we cried. Ex 2:23-25; 3:1-4:31; 6:5; Ps 50:15; 103:1,2; 116:1-4; Jer 33:2 Eph 3:20,21 looked. Ex 4:31; 1Sa 9:16; 2Sa 16:12; Ps 102:19,20; 119:132</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-8","title":"Deuteronomy 26:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the Lord. 4:34; 5:15; Ex 12:37,41,51; 13:3; 14:16-31; Ps 78:12,13; 105:27-38 Ps 106:7-10; Isa 63:12 with great. 4:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-9","title":"Deuteronomy 26:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>he hath. Jos 23:14; 1Sa 7:12; Ps 105:44; 107:7,8; Ac 26:22 a land. Ex 3:8; Eze 20:6,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-10","title":"Deuteronomy 26:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I have. 2; 26:17; 1Ch 29:14; Ro 2:1; 1Pe 4:10,11 And thou. 4; 18:4; Ex 22:29; Nu 18:11-13 and worship. 6:10-13; Ps 22:27,29; 86:9; 95:6; Pr 3:9; Isa 66:23; Re 22:9 1Co 10:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-11","title":"Deuteronomy 26:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>rejoice. 12:7,12,18; 16:11; 28:47; Ps 63:3-5; 100:1,2; Isa 65:14; Zec 9:17 Ac 2:46,47; Php 4:4; 1Ti 6:17,18 the Levite. 1Co 9:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-12","title":"Deuteronomy 26:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the tithes. Le 27:30; Nu 18:24 the third. 14:22-29 hast given it. 12:17-19; 16:14; Pr 14:21; Php 4:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-13","title":"Deuteronomy 26:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Levite. 12; 14:29; 24:19-21; Job 31:16-20 I have not. Ps 18:21-24; 26:1-3,6; Ac 24:16; 2Co 1:12; 11:31; 1Th 2:10 1Jo 3:17-22 forgotten. Ps 119:93,139,141,153,176; Pr 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-14","title":"Deuteronomy 26:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>eaten. 16:11; Le 7:20; 21:1,11; Ho 9:4; Mal 2:13 the dead. Ps 106:28; Eze 24:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-15","title":"Deuteronomy 26:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Look down. 7; 1Ki 8:27,43; Ps 102:19,20; Isa 57:15; 61:1; 63:15; 66:1,2 Zec 2:13; Mt 6:9; Ac 7:49 bless thy. Ps 28:9; 51:18; 90:17; 115:12-15; 137:5,6; Jer 31:23 as thou. Heb 6:13-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-16","title":"Deuteronomy 26:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>This day. 4:1-6; 6:1; 11:1,8; 12:1,32; Mt 28:20 keep. 6:5,17; 8:2; 13:3,4; Joh 14:15,21-24; 1Jo 5:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-17","title":"Deuteronomy 26:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>avouched. 5:2,3; Ex 15:2; 20:19; 24:7; 2Ch 34:31; Isa 12:2; 44:5; Zec 13:9 Ac 27:23; Ro 6:13; 1Co 6:19,20; 2Co 8:5 and to. 10:12,13; 13:4,5; 30:16; Jos 22:5; 1Ki 2:3,4 to keep. Ps 147:19,20 hearken. 13:18; 15:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-18","title":"Deuteronomy 26:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>And the. 7:6; 14:2; 28:9; Ex 6:7; 19:5,6; Jer 31:32-34; Eze 36:25-27 Tit 2:14 keep. Ps 119:6; Ro 16:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-26-19","title":"Deuteronomy 26:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":26,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":26,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>high above. 4:7,8; 28:1; Ps 148:14; Isa 62:12; 66:20,21; Jer 13:11; 33:9 Eze 16:12-14; Zep 3:19; 1Pe 2:5; Re 1:5,6 an holy. 7:6; 28:9; Ex 19:6; 1Pe 2:9</p>"}]}